                    "text": "Gems (no jewel):\nTopaz = +10% Magic Find & +20% Gold Find\nRuby = +20 Life & +2 Life per Kill\nSapphire = +20 Mana & +2 Mana per Kill\nEmerald = +5 Dexterity & +5 Vitality\nSkull = +5 Energy & +5 Vitality\nAmethyst = +5 Strength & +5 Vitality\n\nTir Rune:\nRuby + Tir = +15 Fire Resistance\nSapphire + Tir = +15 Cold Resistance\nTopaz + Tir = +15 Lightning Resistance\nEmerald + Tir = +15 Poison Resistance\nDiamond + Magic Jewel + Tir = +5 All Resistances\n\nMagic Jewel skills:\nTopaz + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Assassin skill & +2 to Assassin skills\nRuby + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Barbarian skill & +2 to Barbarian skills\nSapphire + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Sorceress skill & +2 to Sorceress skills\nEmerald + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Druid skill & +2 to Druid skills\nSkull + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Necromancer skill & +2 to Necromancer skills\nAmethyst + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Amazon skill & +2 to Amazon skills\nDiamond + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Paladin skill & +2 to Paladin skills\nChaos Onyx + Magic Jewel = +2 to a random Warlock skill & +2 to Warlock skills\n\nMagic Jewel + Shael/Dol:\nEmerald + Shael + Magic Jewel = +10% Attack Speed\nSapphire + Dol + Magic Jewel = +10% Faster Cast Rate\n\nInfusion Orb + Rare Jewel:\nTopaz = +25% Magic Find & +50% Gold Find\nRuby = +40 Life & +4 Life per Kill\nSapphire = +40 Mana & +4 Mana per Kill\nDiamond + Um = +15 All Resistances\n\nInfusion Orb + Magic Jewel + Fal:\nEmerald = +15 Dexterity & +15 Vitality\nAmethyst = +15 Strength & +15 Vitality\nSapphire = +15 Energy & +15 Vitality\n\nInfusion Orb + Unique Jewel (class-locked):\nAmazon = +1 to Amazon skills\nAssassin = +1 to Assassin skills\nBarbarian = +1 to Barbarian skills\nDruid = +1 to Druid skills\nNecromancer = +1 to Necromancer skills\nPaladin = +1 to Paladin skills\nSorceress = +1 to Sorceress skills\nWarlock = +1 to Warlock skills\n\nConversion Orb + Unique Jewel:\nZod = +1 All Skills\nBrak = -5% Enemy Phys